{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誤載第七卷之末"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與正燈所錄大異"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與正燈錄四大異"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "序二首誤安卷末道吾語之後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "東山錄也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五卷，一丈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名文會，又曰筠州九\n峯院受業"}
